		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Binas hodie accepi literas, alteras a <persName>Guilhelmo</persName> meo <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Prevost <placeName ref="l378">Parisiensi</placeName>, alteras a <persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName> nostro.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fuerunt utraeque mihi multo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>gratissimae, et quia in utrisque continentur, quę te scire operae pretium <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>est, tumultuariam hanc epistolam e thermis ad te mittendam censui.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName>Guilhelmus</persName> mittit sarcinulam quandam librorum, ex quibus ad <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te quoque unus et alter pertinet; nescio, an <persName ref="p18219">Marcus noster Rostius(?)</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wustius</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illam advehi curet aut alius, spero tamen post <placeName ref="l586">Zurzachianas</placeName> nun<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>dinas nos, quę ille mittit, accepturos.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l522">Venetis</placeName> idem scribit <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in haec verba: "Classem parant 50 triremium, quae <persName>Corcyram</persName> usque <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>emittatur res <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicas</placeName> exploratura.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nudiustertius (datae sunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>autem literae 4. nonas maii) actum est frequenti senatu de classis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>praefecto, qui hodie deductus est magno senatorum comitatu in porticum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quandam palatii splendide et sumptuose ornatam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In hac aerarium <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>reipublicae exhibitum est spectandum toti populo, et ingens <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nummorum acervus ostentatus est, quo significare voluerunt <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nervos reipublicae nequaquam dimminutas esse, et omnia haec ad <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tuendam rempublicam parata esse protestati sunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sparguntur et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>alii rumores; sed ob <placeName>Caesareanos</placeName>, qui literas intercipiunt, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>de singulis scribere tutum non est."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hęc <persName>Guilhelmus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName> vero sic: "Salvus sum et incolumis, sed inter <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>labores et pericula versor gravia; quia enim nocte, quae <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>festum ascensionis pręcessit, quidam exemplum <persName>Gedeonis</persName> imitati <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>reliquias Gaudentii cuiusdam, coelitis pontificii aut Baalim potius, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>una cum imaginibus aliquot destruxere et <placeName ref="l440">Sama<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>deni</placeName> per verbum dei instituti missam finibus suis eiecerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>pharisęi mihi exilium interminantur; quia, ut rationem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>meae doctrinae redderem, vocatus sum meque (ut <persName>Paulus</persName> olim) <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>in iudicio defendi.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sum tamen alacris et intrepidus per gratiam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>dei, non cesso concionari audacter et quotidie per <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>spargo libellos nostra lingua excussos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Statui vos adire brevi, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut vobiscum de rebus aliquot publicis consultem; invalescunt <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>enim papistae et indies accenduntur contra me."</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hęc ex Italico <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>transtuli ex tempore, quia literas tecum communes esse <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>voluit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quod meas res attinet, pater et affinis plurimum observande, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>salvę sunt et incolumes per dei benignitatem, qui mihi adest.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Tuum adventum expecto, qui mihi omni munere erit pręstantior.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Magna commoditate fruimur ob hospitum raritatem, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>quamvis hęc commoditas hospiti magno constet, cuius vicem doleo..</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Sed temporis haec est iniuria, et annonae charitas obstat, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>quominus huc convolent loturi in thermis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quid <persName>Guilhelmus</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>mittat, ex literis ipsius, ubi veneris, intelliges.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Si <persName ref="p18219">Marcus Rostius</persName>(?) sarcinam et literas attulit, oro, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ut eum meo nomine compelles, de vecturae precio scisciteris <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>et illud, si volet, exolvas; ego ut primum, quod <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>expones, reddi curabo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Ignosce, quęso, quod tam familiariter <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>tuam operam expeto; quia enim tua humanitas mihi <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>a pueris nota est, quidvis mihi licere existimo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Plura <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>non possum ob festinam tabellionis abitionem.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Salvam <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>cupio tuam uxorem cum omni tua familia, <persName>Huld[ricum]</persName> item, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>affinem meum, cum sua <persName ref="p8051">Anna</persName> et <persName ref="p477">Rodolfulo</persName>, quem precor <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurina</placeName> ecclesia tanto avo dignum nepotem habeat.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>mi colende pater et affinis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem omnibus vobis precatur <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>mea <persName ref="p5081">Regula</persName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l515">Urdorfi</placeName>, 22. maii 1551<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p2z27"/><persName ref="p8011">Rod[olfus] Gwaltherus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z29"/>Literae <persName ref="p540">Calvino</persName> inscriptae meis, quas a <persName>Guilhelmo</persName> accepi, <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>coniunctae fuerunt; eas ad te mitto, ut <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>vel <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> perferantur, quia, ut per me modo <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>curentur, fieri non potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse f. 328b]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>fidelissimo antistiti, patri et <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>affini suo unice observando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z5"/>An m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrychen <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Bullinger</persName> zuͦ <lb xml:id="p3z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>